समासेनैव कौन्तेय निष्ठा ज्ञानस्य या परा ॥ ५० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4727,\"bb\":4137,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/50/b4137/\",\"body_value\":\"siddhiṁ prāpto yathā brahma
